WEBVTT

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.740
How can I end this duel with both of us safe?

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.240
I'll bet it all on this draw!

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.830
What did I just see?

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:18.500
Did the legendary nameless dragon choose me?

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:23.280
I can sense the infinite possibilities of this card.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:28.020
Please lend me your strength, Claw of Hermos!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:48.070
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:55.210
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:01.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:07.860
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:15.230
With our memories fading

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:22.310
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:29.210
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:36.440
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:01.970
Hermos's Miracle

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:03.900
Hermos!

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.020
Lend me your strength!

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:09.380
Can that be?

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:11.050
It's the same as Yugi's.

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:17.480
Yes.  The legendary dragon recognized Jonouchi as a true duelist.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:21.710
Impossible.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:24.590
Jonouchi has the power of the legendary dragon?

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:28.800
We may have underestimated him.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.530
This proves he's a worthy duelist.

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:35.750
Claw of Hermos?  Never heard of that card.

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:40.080
Did Pegasus give them rare cards?

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:42.100
What?   Just them?

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.480
They're so lucky!

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:48.850
If I don't hurry, they'll be...

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:57.720
Good!  The power is still on!

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.560
Just need to open the locks!

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:07.490
I sense strong power from that card.

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.610
What is it?

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:12.550
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:14.110
Monster Reborn!

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.770
I resurrect The Fiend Megacyber!

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:28.190
That's pointless!  Megacyber's 2200 attack points can't defeat Harpie's Pet Dragon!

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.190
But I'm still betting on it!

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:35.680
I summon Time Wizard in attack position!

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:41.000
And I activate Claw of Hermos!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.080
Come out, Hermos!

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:57.050
Hermos combines with a monster on my field and becomes an Equip Card!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.520
C'mon, Hermos!

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.860
Create a miracle!

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.040
Huh?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.020
What is that?

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:27.910
After all that?  What can you do with a toy?

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:36.630
Aww c'mon.  That's supposed to be powerful?

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.730
Jonouchi, you must've made a mistake!

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:41.340
No, it's fine.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.900
Yeah.  I sense Hermos's power.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.980
It doesn't matter what it looks like!

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:52.540
I don't know what this weapon can do, but I'm going for it!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.570
I equip Time Magic Hammer on Megacyber!

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:03.180
Go, Time Magic Hammer!

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:08.800
He's attacking even though its attack points haven't changed?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:09.910
He's so dumb!

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:13.920
Something's up.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:20.960
No matter what Claw of Hermos's effect is, it won't work on me.

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:23.400
Harpie Lady Sparrow Formation!

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:32.480
Even if Megacyber's attack points rise, battle damage will be 0!

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:35.410
My tactics have no weaknesses!

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:54.130
What are those numbers?

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:57.500
I don't know.  But nothing's changed.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:01.900
Too bad, Jonouchi!

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:05.550
I overestimated the legendary dragon's power.

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.480
Nothing happened.

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:12.780
I end my turn.

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:16.320
Are you mocking me, Jonouchi?

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:21.220
You didn't want to duel me seriously to begin with.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.920
Mai!  I-

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.040
That's enough!

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:26.670
Let's end this.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:30.180
I'll end this silly duel immediately!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:32.340
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.250
My monsters!

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:47.440
What's going on?

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:51.290
Mai's monsters disappeared!

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.960
What's going on?

00:06:55.490 --> 00:07:00.580
Claw of Hermos's power is to make monsters disappear?

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.360
No, I don't think so.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:03.930
There's more to this.

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:07.340
The spatial distortion is still there.

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:11.780
What did you do to my Harpies?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.210
I don't know!

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:18.310
I set a card and end my turn!

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.420
I don't know what happened...

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:23.580
...but since Mai's field is empty, now's my chance!

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.850
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:28.490
Megacyber!  Attack Mai directly!

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:41.480
Sorry, Mai.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:42.830
Damn!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:46.240
He truly is a duelist chosen by a legendary dragon.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.600
Mai...

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:54.050
I set a card and end my turn.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.980
Just a little more.  And we'll be tied.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:00.910
Then we can both be saved!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:08.540
I won't lose...  I can't lose...

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.260
If I lose...

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:24.480
By gaining Doma's power, I've become stronger!

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.140
So I won't lose!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.250
Mai?

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:30.190
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:36.350
Mai's monster is back!

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:38.040
What's going on?

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.000
I see!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.930
Those numbers.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:46.840
When attacked by Time Magic Hammer, numbers appeared.

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:50.940
Mai's monsters were sent to the future for that many turns.

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:53.940
So a monster with 1 returns next turn.

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:57.880
And a monster with 6 won't return for six turns.

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:02.190
During that time, he can rebuild his battle formation.

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:09.830
This is Time Magic Hammer's effect - the Equip Card formed by fusing Claw of Hermos and Time Wizard.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:16.600
And since her Harpie Ladies haven't returned, Harpie's Pet Dragon loses attack points.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:21.400
But it's still stronger than Megacyber.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:24.800
It's back!

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:27.580
My monster is back!

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.580
I'll be fine.  I won't lose.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.040
I'm going to win.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.730
Harpie's Pet Dragon!

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.570
Attack Megacyber!

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.680
She's losing her cool.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:39.450
Mai!

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:43.080
I flip over my set card!

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.060
Skull Dice!

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:50.730
The die roll determines how many attack points your monster loses!

00:09:56.550 --> 00:10:01.710
All right!  Harpie's Pet Dragon's attack points are halved!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.960
No!  I won't lose!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.130
Mai?

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:21.120
I... I'm going to win.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.060
I must win!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.350
This isn't good.

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:27.390
Valon?

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:35.140
Piece of Orichalcos!  Release your power!

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.000
Valon!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.760
The seal has vanished.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.310
Don't be rash.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:04.770
The Orichalcos protects us.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:09.210
But if you forcefully break the seal, you may die!

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:13.650
But I couldn't let her continue!

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:19.250
Next time we meet, I'll get your soul...

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:20.990
...Nameless Pharaoh!

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:38.170
Okay!  It should open!

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:45.620
Mai?  Where are they?

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:47.660
Jonouchi!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.050
Jonouchi!

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:50.050
Are you okay?

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.140
Pull yourself together!  Jonouchi!

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.060
Jonouchi!

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:00.430
What happened to Mai?

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:01.800
Well...

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:03.430
She vanished.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.100
No way!

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:06.740
No way...

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:10.860
Damn!

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:12.480
Mai!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.860
Damn...  Damn!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.570
Why, Mai?

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:40.170
Jonouchi, now you know.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:42.420
Mai betrayed us.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.970
She sided with our enemy!

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:48.510
Don't say that!  We're not sure of that!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:50.440
Stop fooling yourself!

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.340
You saw what Mai did!

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:57.400
She really tried to take Jonouchi's soul!

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.070
Jonouchi...

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.980
Kaiba!

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:12.260
Yugi!

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:14.230
Jonouchi!  Everyone!

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.040
Yugi!

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:17.970
You too, Otogi?

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.910
Kaiba?  What's going on?

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:23.930
Why are you here?

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:26.350
Pegasus invited us.

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:27.630
Pegasus?

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:29.770
Is Pegasus okay?

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:33.470
By the time we arrived...

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:40.790
Mai Kujaku teamed up with Doma and took Pegasus's soul.

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:42.730
Doma?

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:46.170
Kaiba, you know Doma too?

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:50.200
My brother fought Doma's Amelda.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:54.880
He pretended to be Pegasus to trap my brother!

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.580
But I let him get away.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:59.060
I see.  That's why you came here.

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:04.250
So Pegasus's illusion summoned us all.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:09.190
Yes.  Pegasus knew he was in danger.

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:15.360
Yugi boy, I must talk to you in person.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:23.970
But I can't come to you because someone is watching me.

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:30.540
If Pegasus knew he was in danger, he would've thoroughly taken action.

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:32.410
Just like when he duels.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:37.040
Pegasus sent me this card.

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:40.930
Pegasus must have left a clue here!

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:46.460
Yugi!  There was one room I couldn't unlock!

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:47.950
That's it!

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.400
Lead the way.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:51.520
Huh?  Sure.

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:55.070
Kaiba!  Cocky as ever!

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:58.010
Let's go, Jonouchi.

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:00.080
Y-Yeah.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:08.780
Huh?  They didn't even notice us.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:14.880
That's good!  That room must have Pegasus's rare cards!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:19.660
Yeah!  Let's get the treasure!

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:33.700
This is it.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.840
This is the only door I couldn't unlock.

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:49.680
It's dark.  I can't see anything.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.840
I hope there's not another Doma trap.

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:03.740
What is this place?

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:04.570
Wow!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:08.640
It's like we stepped into a toy box.

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:11.780
How annoying!  Such bad taste!

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:16.750
Pegasus will definitely have the rarest cards!

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:18.950
You're right!  I can even smell 'em!

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:22.090
Pegasus!

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:24.530
This is Solid Vision.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:28.980
Yugi boy.  Welcome to my private room.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:33.360
It's my dreamland that heals my soul.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:34.970
Do you like it?

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.640
This is why people don't like you.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.410
Be quiet!

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:41.880
But Yugi boy...

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:49.320
By the time you see this message, I know I'm not safe.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:50.750
Pegasus.

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:55.120
An organization has taken over my company.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.460
Same with me.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:17:01.640
Someone is trying to buy all Kaiba Corporation stock.

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:02.430
Big brother...

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:10.300
This secret society is rumored to be as rich as America.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.370
Doma.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:12.940
Doma?

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.540
Secret society?

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:19.540
Thousands of years ago, since the start of human civilization...

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:27.680
...every time an unexpected event occurred in the world, Doma was pulling the strings.

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:31.380
You must've learned this in your textbooks.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:36.930
Was the rise and fall of the Roman Empire inevitable?

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:43.870
During the Age of Discovery, who really funded and supplied goods?

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:50.540
Did people really spontaneously lead revolutions?

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:55.480
Who gave Napoleon his power?

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:59.820
The sudden start of the Industrial Revolution...

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:03.520
And the art revival of the Renaissance...

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:08.430
Who funded these events?

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.100
But there's no proof.

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:19.720
Because everyone who tried to learn the truth vanished.

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:26.550
But I believe they've meddled with history.

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:28.710
Meddle with history?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:32.240
Doma is once again making their move.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:37.000
Using the power of my creation - Duel Monsters.

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:41.620
This time, they're doing more than meddling with history.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:46.040
Their plan is something evil and terrifying.

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:47.400
Plan...

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:49.230
Soon...

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:56.980
Yugi, your soul will soon be sacrificed to our god.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.440
Sacrificed?

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:03.200
Yes.  The loser's soul will be sacrificed to our god...

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.800
...who'll lead this dirty world to destruction.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:09.460
And feed the creation of a new world!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:17.480
Yugi boy, I invited you so I could tell you about this.

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:21.740
And I want to give you something.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:27.770
I created a new card and hid it in this room.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.130
Card?

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:35.650
I wanted to give it to you in person, but I had no choice.

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:39.700
I know you can find it.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:41.560
Pot of Greed!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:45.120
It has nothing to do with Toon World!

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:46.790
Mine!

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:52.800
Ah!  Found it!

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:56.270
Weird.  Nothing's on it.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:58.510
Maybe it's not finished yet.

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:00.210
Then it's trash.

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:03.010
A nameless card...

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:11.160
Yugi boy, please save my cute monsters.

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:15.880
Only you can complete this task, Yugi boy.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:24.050
What?  I don't get it!

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:27.130
A secret society that's lasted for thousands of years?

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:29.810
Why would Mai join them?

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:32.240
"Leave Doma alone."

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:37.170
I remember now.  That's what Gozaburo said.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:42.440
In the shadows of the world economy, there's a darkness that must be avoided.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:47.040
But I thought it was the mutterings of a coward.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:48.090
Yugi!

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:53.020
No matter how hard you fight, you can't beat them!

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:55.690
Wrong, Kaiba!  Don't be so sure!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:21:01.870
They may be too big to defeat alone.  However...

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:07.040
That's...

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.140
Claw of Hermos.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:16.890
Kaiba, I know you have a card too.

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:22.990
Fang of Critias.

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:39.070
We may be able to defeat Doma if we work together.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:42.010
That's what the cards are telling us.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:06.910
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:15.250
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:26.410
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:35.930
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:44.960
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.740 --> 00:22:50.470
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:55.650
For me to be me

00:22:55.650 --> 00:23:04.110
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:09.750
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.270 --> 00:23:19.410
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:29.260
Pegasus's vision revealed Doma's crazy identity.

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:34.860
If that's the enemy we're facing, how should we fight them?

00:23:34.860 --> 00:23:44.180
Our only hope is Yugi, Kaiba and Jonouchi's legendary dragon cards from the Duel Monsters world.

